---
const manifest = '/intelligence/v1/manifest.json';
const bootstrap = '/.well-known/greensquare-intelligence.json';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
  <title>GreenSquare Intelligence Layer</title>
  <style>
    body{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px;background:#10110f;color:#f5f5f5}
    a{color:#d8ddd8} li{margin:.7rem 0} h1{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:3rem;letter-spacing:-.04em}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>GreenSquare Intelligence Layer</h1>
  <p>Machine-first canonical operating specification. This page is an inspection surface, not doctrine.</p>
  <ol>
    <li><a href={bootstrap}>Bootstrap</a></li>
    <li><a href={manifest}>Manifest</a></li>
    <li><a href="/intelligence/v1/router.json">Router</a></li>
    <li><a href="/intelligence/v1/core.json">Root contract, authority, evidence, quality gates</a></li>
    <li><a href="/intelligence/v1/judgment-os.json">Judgment OS</a></li>
    <li><a href="/intelligence/v1/knowledge.json">Knowledge and product</a></li>
    <li><a href="/intelligence/v1/execution.json">Social, content and launch execution</a></li>
    <li><a href="/intelligence/v1/design-communication.json">Design and communication</a></li>
    <li><a href="/intelligence/v1/audit.json">Current-system audit</a></li>
  </ol>
  <p>Canonical precedence and module relationships are defined in the manifest. Agents should retrieve selectively through the router.</p>
</body>
</html>
